class_name Rooms
## The rooms of the game, played in order. Each map is drawn with text:
##   #  solid stone         =  platform you can jump up through
##   P  player start       D  exit door (opens when the room is cleared)
##   s  slime              b  bat              B  the Slime King (boss)
##   .  empty space
## Maps are 38 tiles wide and are lined up with the floor, so you only need
## to write the rows that contain something. The outer walls are automatic.
## "unlocks" gives the player a new fighting style when the room is cleared
## (1 = Blade Dance, 2 = Frost Nova).

